WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Original teaching tutorial. CodeBreakers is a fictional club.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
Create index.html. Add the doctype, HTML, head and body.

00:18.000 --> 00:30.000
Set UTF-8, viewport and title. Add a heading and two paragraphs.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Save and open the file. The title is on the tab; content is in the page.

00:40.000 --> 00:52.000
Create About, Activities, Media and Contact at the same folder level.

00:52.000 --> 01:05.000
Use relative links and local CSS/images. Test links, keyboard and offline use.

01:05.000 --> 01:30.000
Build a small working page, then improve it milestone by milestone.
